This product is an independent Windows-native resource monitor written in Rust,
inspired by and aiming for configuration, theme, and UX compatibility with
btop++ (https://github.com/aristocratos/btop), Copyright 2021-2026 Aristocratos
(Jakob P. Liljenberg), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream theme files bundled from aristocratos/btop (when added in M5) retain
their original Apache-2.0 license and attribution, with any Windows-specific
adaptations clearly noted.
